<title>USA: Elamex completes acquisition of Eurotec.</title>
<headline>Elamex completes acquisition of Eurotec.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elamex SA de CV said Thursday it completed the acquisition of Eurotec's businesses through an asset based transaction.</p>
<p>Eurotec is a Mexico-based company that makes plastic moulding and metal stamping.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Eurotec will become a new division of Elamex.</p>
</text>
